	(text "USB-C input, over-voltage switch, charger and battery, the ideal-diode power path, the voltage dividers to\nthe M5PM1 ADC, the power key and the status LED.\n\nMain parts: J1 USB-C, U7 AW32901FCR, U15 LGS4056 charger, J4 battery, U6 U11 U13 U14 CH213K, U12 AW35122FDR,\nQ2 CJ3439KDW, S1 power key, LED1"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 48.26 0)
		(effects
