				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "83548816-88a0-504b-8258-533df4554368")
	)
	(text "Every part, pin and net of the M5StickS3, with the values the vendor\ndocuments: connectivity documented from the vendor's public documentation,\nwith Kleidos additions and corrections listed on page 1\n(M5Stack's K150 StickS3 schematic V0.6, 2025-11-11, and its docs page,\ncited in README.md and netlist.yaml beside this file). Layout and\nsymbols are this project's. No footprints, no PCB, no part numbers\nbeyond the documented ones.\nValues are as the vendor prints them (10K/1%, 22uF/10V). A value of NC\nmeans not fitted: those parts are marked DNP.\nReference designators are the vendor's, not renumbered. The daughterboard\nreuses the main board's, so its parts are numbered +100 here (its U1 is\nU101); J6, the LCD connector, carries no designator in the print.\nNets the vendor left unnamed carry names of ours (U12_EN, SCL_ISO...).\nZones: columns 1-8 and rows A-F, 50 mm apart, printed in the border."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 100.505 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.75 1.75)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3234ff33-e65f-56d5-9aef-9ca064a98174")
	)
